  "context": "Source: tuning remediation plan rev2, task P5.3 (R-7), plus tuning-evidence plan step 2. Preserve D-3 local diagnostics with username redaction; outward publish/export/submission stay fully anonymized; print verification summary after every run.\n\nHistorical implementation and review fixes are in PR #2863. Current head `84d2b372bb19e40f65428752a36362a899031bb1` includes commit `84d2b37` correcting High D13: dirty `.tuning.json`/`.applied.json` sidecars now fail closed instead of being silently omitted. The copy guard requires `_copy_clean_companion(...) is True` for `.plans`, `.tuning`, and `.applied`. Regression coverage parameterizes dirty applied/tuning companions and asserts `publish_bundle` returns `None` without creating the target. The prior D10 fix rescans redacted primary and companions with tuning and plans detectors.\n\nVerification on current head: `uv run -- python -m pytest -q tests/unit/core/results/test_local_result_diagnosability.py` — 36 passed; `make pr-preflight` — 98 passed, ruff/format passed; pre-commit comment policy passed. `make pr-open` pushed the head and updated PR #2863. D10 and D13 inline threads were replied to and resolved; `/oracle-review` was requested on current head. At last read, CI run 38135173455 was queued. Oracle check run 38135193315 reported it was waiting for an Oracle review of head 84d2b37; this is a missing verdict, not a new code finding.\n\nThe prior local full-fast run timed out after 3600 seconds at 99% and is not a pass; GitHub full tests passed on previous head 314498, not this head. Mergeability scan still reports overlap with PR #2875 in `benchbox/cli/commands/run.py`; coordinate/rebase after #2875 before landing. Do not arm until current-head Oracle review and all required checks pass, and resolve the #2875 overlap. Do not finish until PR #2863 is merged and acceptance is verified.",
  "description": "## Problem\nThe user's local result file redacts receipt statements and reasons (`exporter.py:105` defaults `anonymize=True`), and the console prints no verification summary.\n\n## Change (per gate D-3)\n- Apply the decided local-file anonymization default or flag.\n- After every run, print status, counts by verdict, the top 3 reasons, and the dropped intents.\n\n## Guardrails (must preserve)\n- Publish and public export stay fully anonymized.\n\n## Process guardrails\n- One PR per item against `develop`, via the AGENTS.md worktree flow (`make worktree-claim BRANCH=...`, `make agent-write-preflight`).\n- Verification ladder: `uv run -- python -m pytest -m fast -q`, `uv run -- ruff check .`, `uv run -- ruff format --check .` and `uv run -- ty check`.\n- Then `make pr-preflight` and `make pr-open`.\n- Stage explicit paths; never `git add -A`.\n- No live cloud runs without explicit user approval stating the command, maximum runtime, log path and stop condition.\n- Re-read every file:line anchor before editing. Anchors are from develop d39166ea.",
